title: <span style="color: #3F7BC1;">**DNVP**</span> Leadership Vote
subtitle: The <span style="color: #3F7BC1;">**DNVP**</span> decides their fate...
view-if: dnvp_leader = "Triumvirate" and year = 1929 and month = 11
max-visits: 1
tags: event
face-image: img/portraits/HergtOskar.jpg
new-page: true

= <span style="color: #3F7BC1;">**DNVP**</span> Congress

Division between its many factions has always plagued the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**DNVP**</span>, yet it seems the recent years have been dome of the worst. Hugenber's increasingly radical policies have alienated the party's moderates. It seems a split is inevetable.

- @resultsdnvp: The congress unfolds...

@resultsdnvp
go-to: treviranus if young_plan_signatures < 10; hugenberg if young_plan_signatures >= 10

@treviranus
on-arrival: dnvp_leader = "Treviranus"; dnvp_tory_democracy = 1; rural_dnf += 3; rural_dnvp -= 3; new_middle_dnvp += 3; workers_dnvp += 1; catholics_dnvp += 3; pro_republic += 5; dvp_left += 1; dnvp_relation += 10 if dvp_ideology = "Left"; dnvp_relation -= 5 if dvp_ideology = "Right";
face-image: img/portraits/TreviranusGottfried.jpg

Gottfried Treviranus has been elected as leader of the <span style="color: #3F7BC1;">**DNVP**</span>, a member of the Young Conservative faction and is supportive of transforming the party into a constructive conservative force. The defeat of the radical right and national conservative forces within the <span style="color: #3F7BC1;">**DNVP**</span> helps pave the way for Treviranus' vision of a Christian Democratic, albeit nationalist party.

@hugenberg
on-arrival: dnvp_leader = "Hugenberg"; dnvp_ideology = "Radical"; workers_dnvp -= 2; pro_republic -= 2; dvp_right += 1; dnvp_relation -= 5 if dvp_ideology = "Left";
face-image: img/portraits/HugenbergAlfred.jpg
go-to: kvp_formed

Hugenberg is elected <span style="color: #3F7BC1;">**DNVP**</span> chairman. The anti-Hugenberg members have left to the <i>Konservative Volkspartei</i> (Conservative People's Party)
